<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Gourmet &amp; Soups</title>
<style>
:root{
  --plane:#f9f9f7; --surface-1:#fcfcfb;
  --text-primary:#0b0b0b; --text-secondary:#52514e; --muted:#898781;
  --grid:#e1e0d9; --baseline:#c3c2b7; --border:rgba(11,11,11,0.10);
  --s1:#2a78d6; --s2:#eb6834; --s3:#1baf7a;
  --good:#0ca30c; --warning:#fab219; --critical:#d03b3b;
  --seq-2:#9ec5f4; --seq-4:#3987e5; --seq-6:#184f95;
  --ghost:rgba(11,11,11,0.045);
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){ :root:where(:not([data-theme="light"])){
  --plane:#0d0d0d; --surface-1:#1a1a19;
  --text-primary:#ffffff; --text-secondary:#c3c2b7; --muted:#898781;
  --grid:#2c2c2a; --baseline:#383835; --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
  --s1:#3987e5; --s2:#d95926; --s3:#199e70;
  --seq-2:#184f95; --seq-4:#3987e5; --seq-6:#9ec5f4;
  --ghost:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{
  --plane:#0d0d0d; --surface-1:#1a1a19;
  --text-primary:#ffffff; --text-secondary:#c3c2b7; --muted:#898781;
  --grid:#2c2c2a; --baseline:#383835; --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
  --s1:#3987e5; --s2:#d95926; --s3:#199e70;
  --seq-2:#184f95; --seq-4:#3987e5; --seq-6:#9ec5f4;
  --ghost:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--plane);color:var(--text-primary);
  font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 20px 64px}
header.top{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between}
h1{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 2px;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.sub{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:12.5px;margin:0}
.bar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:16px 0 0;
  background:var(--surface-1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20}
.bar .lab{font-size:11.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--muted);margin-right:2px}
.bar .sep{width:1px;height:22px;background:var(--grid);margin:0 4px}
button.ctl,select.ctl{font:inherit;font-size:13px;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;
  background:var(--plane);color:var(--text-primary);border:1px solid var(--border)}
button.ctl[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--text-primary);color:var(--surface-1);border-color:var(--text-primary)}
button.ctl:hover:not([aria-pressed="true"]):not(:disabled){background:var(--ghost)}
button.ctl:disabled,select.ctl:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
td.io{white-space:nowrap}
.iotag{display:inline-block;font:500 11.5px/1.55 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
  background:var(--ghost);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:5px;padding:1px 6px;
  cursor:pointer;color:var(--text-secondary);user-select:all}
.iotag:hover{background:var(--plane);color:var(--text-primary)}
.iotag.ok{color:var(--good);border-color:var(--good);user-select:none}
.iomore{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-left:2px}
section{background:var(--surface-1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;margin-top:16px}
h2{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 3px;letter-spacing:-0.005em}
.note{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:12.5px;margin:0 0 15px;max-width:80ch}
.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(166px,1fr));gap:12px}
.tile{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:11px;padding:13px 14px}
.tile .lab{font-size:11.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
.tile .val{font-size:25px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.05}
.tile .foot{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-top:5px}
.chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;
  padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--border);white-space:nowrap}
.chip svg{width:11px;height:11px;flex:none}
.city-h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:650;color:var(--text-secondary)}
.city-h:first-child{margin-top:2px}
.city-h .rule{flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--grid)}
.legend{display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary)}
.legend .k{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.sw{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;flex:none}
.stack{display:flex;height:28px;border-radius:4px;gap:2px}
.stackrow{margin-bottom:8px}
.stacklab{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:5px}
.bars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
.brow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:118px 1fr 156px;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}
.brow:hover{background:var(--ghost)}
.brow.sel{background:var(--ghost);outline:1px solid var(--border)}
.bname{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.btrack{height:15px}
.bfill{height:15px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;background:var(--s1)}
.bmeta{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}
.bmeta b{color:var(--text-primary);font-weight:600}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
th{text-align:left;font-size:11.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted);
  font-weight:600;padding:7px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--grid);white-space:nowrap}
td{padding:7px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--grid);vertical-align:middle}
td.n,th.n{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
tr.itemrow{cursor:pointer}
tr.itemrow:hover>td{background:var(--ghost)}
tr.podrow td{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);background:var(--ghost)}
tr.podrow td:first-child{padding-left:26px}
.mini{display:inline-flex;gap:1.5px;align-items:flex-end;height:14px}
.mini i{width:3px;background:var(--s1);border-radius:1px 1px 0 0;display:block}
.mini i.z{background:var(--critical)}
.pill{font-size:11px;padding:1.5px 7px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text-secondary);white-space:nowrap}
.tools{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px}
input[type=search]{font:inherit;font-size:13px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px;
  border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--plane);color:var(--text-primary);min-width:190px}
.funnel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;max-width:620px}
.fstep{display:grid;grid-template-columns:74px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:center}
.flab{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary)}
.ffill{height:25px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;padding-left:9px;
  font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tip{position:fixed;pointer-events:none;z-index:60;background:var(--text-primary);color:var(--surface-1);
  font-size:12px;padding:7px 9px;border-radius:7px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .09s;max-width:300px;
  box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.18);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.foothint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}
.kv{display:flex;gap:5px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);flex-wrap:wrap}
.drill{margin-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--grid);padding-top:14px}
.drill h3{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 8px}
.chartbox{width:100%}
svg text{font-family:inherit}
.catgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:10px}
.catcard{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:11px;padding:12px 13px;cursor:pointer}
.catcard:hover{background:var(--ghost)}
.catcard .cn{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:2px}
.catcard .cf{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
.catcard .cd{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-top:3px}
.meter{height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--grid);margin-top:8px;overflow:hidden}
.meter i{display:block;height:6px;border-radius:3px}
@media(max-width:640px){ .brow{grid-template-columns:92px 1fr 126px} .tile .val{font-size:21px} }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<noscript><div style="background:#fee;color:#900;padding:14px;margin:14px;border:1px solid #900;border-radius:8px;font:14px sans-serif">
  This file needs JavaScript to run, and your browser has it turned off (or blocked it for this file). Try opening it in Chrome or Edge — if you already are, drag this file into an already-open browser window rather than double-clicking it.
</div></noscript>
<div id="jsFatalError" style="display:none;background:#fee;color:#900;padding:14px;margin:14px;border:1px solid #900;border-radius:8px;font:13px/1.5 monospace;white-space:pre-wrap"></div>
<script>
window.addEventListener('error', function(e){
  var el=document.getElementById('jsFatalError'); if(!el) return;
  el.style.display='block';
  el.textContent += 'Script error: ' + (e.message||'unknown') + (e.filename?(' — '+e.filename+':'+e.lineno+':'+e.colno):'') + '\n';
});
window.addEventListener('unhandledrejection', function(e){
  var el=document.getElementById('jsFatalError'); if(!el) return;
  el.style.display='block';
  el.textContent += 'Promise error: ' + ((e.reason && (e.reason.message||e.reason)) || 'unknown') + '\n';
});
</script>
<div class="wrap">
<header class="top">
  <div>
    <h1>Gourmet &amp; Soups — supply &amp; sales</h1>
    <p class="sub">Indented → Sent → Received, and what actually sold, for the gourmet and soup range · BLR · same date &amp; status rules as the IO Fill Rate log</p>
    <p class="sub" id="jsReady" style="color:#b45309">Checking script… (if this line never changes, JavaScript isn't running for this file in this browser)</p>
  </div>
  <button class="ctl" id="themeBtn" aria-pressed="false">Dark</button>
</header>

<section id="uploadSection">
  <h2>Upload today's file(s)</h2>
  <p class="note">Drop in today's raw Internal Order CSV export(s), and your sales export alongside them — any number at once; I work out which is which from the columns. Only the tracked gourmet &amp; soup lines are kept, so this file stays small. Everything is parsed and computed right here in your browser; nothing is uploaded anywhere. When you're done, click <b>Download updated dashboard</b> and save it — that file is your new dashboard, with today folded in.</p>
  <input type="file" id="fileInput" accept=".csv" multiple>
  <div style="margin-top:10px">
    <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);cursor:pointer">
      <input type="checkbox" id="overwriteChk"> Overwrite a date if it's already in this file (use to correct a mistake, or to backfill after changing the tracked list)
    </label>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <button class="ctl" id="processBtn" aria-pressed="false">Process files</button>
    <button class="ctl" id="downloadBtn" aria-pressed="false" disabled>Download updated dashboard (.html)</button>
  </div>
  <div id="salesMap" style="display:none;margin-top:14px;padding:13px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--ghost)">
    <div style="font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">Sales file detected — check these columns</div>
    <p class="note" style="margin:0 0 10px">I picked these from the file's headers. Change anything that looks wrong, then press <b>Process files</b>. The choice is remembered for next time.</p>
    <div class="tools" style="gap:8px">
      <label style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary)">Date <select class="ctl" id="scDate"></select></label>
      <label style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary)">Store <select class="ctl" id="scPod"></select></label>
      <label style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary)">Item <select class="ctl" id="scItem"></select></label>
      <label style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary)">Qty sold <select class="ctl" id="scQty"></select></label>
    </div>
    <p class="foothint" id="scPreview" style="margin-top:8px"></p>
  </div>
  <pre id="uploadLog" style="display:none;background:var(--ghost);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:12px;margin-top:12px;font-size:12.5px;white-space:pre-wrap;max-height:260px;overflow:auto"></pre>
</section>

<div class="bar">
  <span class="lab">Date</span>
  <select class="ctl" id="dateSel"></select>
  <button class="ctl" id="removeDateBtn" title="Remove the selected date from this dashboard" disabled>Delete this date</button>
  <span class="sep"></span>
  <span class="lab">Range</span>
  <select class="ctl" id="grpSel"></select>
  <span class="sep"></span>
  <span class="lab">Store</span>
  <select class="ctl" id="storeSel" title="Narrow the whole dashboard to one store"></select>
</div>

<section>
  <h2 id="glanceH">At a glance</h2>
  <p class="note" id="glanceNote">Fill rate is Sent ÷ Indented. <b>Short units</b> is the gross shortfall felt at store level — every store's own shortfall added up, so an over-send to one store never hides a starved one elsewhere.</p>
  <div id="tiles"></div>
</section>

<section id="secGroups">
  <h2>Gourmet vs Soups, this date</h2>
  <p class="note">Click a card to narrow the dashboard to that range.</p>
  <div id="grpcards"></div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Day-wise trend</h2>
  <p class="note" id="trendNote">Fill rate and gross short units by date for the selected range. Hover for the exact day.</p>
  <div class="legend" id="trendLegend"></div>
  <div class="chartbox" id="chartFill"></div>
  <div class="chartbox" id="chartShort" style="margin-top:6px"></div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2 id="itemsH">Every item</h2>
  <p class="note" id="itemsNote">Every tracked item indented this date, biggest shortfall first. Click a row for the store-level split of what was actually sent. Click any IO number to copy it for a Shoptree search.</p>
  <div class="tools">
    <input type="search" id="q" placeholder="Search item, store, or IO number…" aria-label="Search item, store, or IO number">
    <button class="ctl" id="fltAll" aria-pressed="true">All items</button>
    <button class="ctl" id="fltShort" aria-pressed="false">Short-supplied only</button>
    <button class="ctl" id="fltZero" aria-pressed="false">Has zero-supplied stores</button>
  </div>
  <div style="overflow-x:auto"><table id="itemtbl"><thead><tr id="itemHead"></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
  <p class="foothint" id="itemcount"></p>
</section>

<section id="secStores">
  <h2>Store by store</h2>
  <p class="note">Every store carrying the selected range, ranked by gross short units. Click a store to see its own item lines.</p>
  <div class="tools">
    <button class="ctl" id="podSortShort" aria-pressed="true">Sort by short units</button>
    <button class="ctl" id="podSortFill" aria-pressed="false">Sort by fill %</button>
  </div>
  <div id="podbars"></div>
  <div id="poddrill"></div>
</section>

<section id="secLive">
  <h2 id="liveH">Live check — is what you indent actually selling?</h2>
  <p class="note" id="liveNote">Every store line that was indented, checked against what that store actually sold the same day. A line that was <b>sent but sold nothing</b> is the one to act on — the RM went out but the SKU isn't moving, or isn't live on that store's menu at all.</p>
  <div id="liveSummary"></div>
  <div class="tools" style="margin-top:12px">
    <button class="ctl" id="lvFlag" aria-pressed="true">Indented but not selling</button>
    <button class="ctl" id="lvAll" aria-pressed="false">All lines</button>
    <button class="ctl" id="lvGrid" aria-pressed="false">Coverage grid</button>
  </div>
  <div id="liveBody"></div>
</section>

<section id="secAlias" style="display:none">
  <h2>Sales names that didn't match</h2>
  <p class="note">These item names came from the sales file but don't line up with anything in the tracked list, so their sales are being ignored. Map each one to the item it belongs to — otherwise that item will look like it sold nothing, which would show up as a false "not selling" flag. Mappings are remembered in this file.</p>
  <div id="aliasBody"></div>
</section>

<section id="secRegistry">
  <h2>Items tracked</h2>
  <p class="note">This dashboard only keeps the items listed here — that's what lets the file stay small. When a new gourmet item or soup goes live, add it below, then re-upload that day's file with <b>Overwrite</b> ticked to backfill it. Items added here apply to every upload from now on.</p>
  <div id="registry"></div>
  <div class="tools" style="margin-top:14px">
    <select class="ctl" id="regGroup"></select>
    <input type="search" id="regNew" list="regCatalog" placeholder="Item name, exactly as it reads in Shoptree…" aria-label="Item to add" style="min-width:320px">
    <datalist id="regCatalog"></datalist>
    <button class="ctl" id="regAddBtn">Add item</button>
  </div>
  <p class="foothint" id="regHint"></p>
</section>
</div>
